{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粵艇南下今日起實施，政府舉行首航儀式歡迎首批遊艇。署理財政司司長黃偉綸表示，感謝中央政府大力支持推動計劃落成，香港發展遊艇經濟反映世界趨勢，將全面積極推出多項便利遊艇來港的措施。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:19:47.805935+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:50.006867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:43.081238+00:00","content_hash":"c8abb6e343f2f4af5b596939a96904bb15c49e5524ef79d390982d1a8790c651","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}